ught silly, snot-filled fun to life with this classic toy VO.\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container page-header-nav-wrap","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-content","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Gooey Louie Voiceover"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Voiceover of the TV Advert for the crazy kids toy from Ideal Toys - Gooey Louie</p>"}}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-arrows","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/turtle-strike-voiceover","className":"page-header-arrow","title":"Turtle Strike Voiceover","aria-label":"Previous: Turtle Strike Voiceover","children":"‹"}],["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/minecraft-handbook-voiceover","className":"page-header-arrow","title":"Minecraft Handbook Voiceover","aria-label":"Next: Minecraft Handbook Voiceover","children":"›"}]]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Christmas Toys for Kids</h2>\r\n<p>As you can tell, I do a lot of kids toys voiceovers for TV. I guess my energetic voice is a great fit with this industry. I also  have a popular <a href=\"/santa-voice\" title=\"Santa Voiceover\">Santa voiceover</a> that is used every year.\r\nI actually recorded this particular Gooey Louie voiceover a few years ago now, but due to it's popularity at Christmas, it's on every year. <br>As a voice you can't say no to re-licence fees. 😏<br>\r\nThere were several new toys launched around this time including <a href=\"/doggie-doo-voice-over\" title=\"Doggie Doo TV Advert\">Doggie Doo</a> and <a href=\"/pig-goes-pop-voiceover\" title=\"Pig goes Pop\">Pig goes Pop</a>. And if you'd like to hear even more of my kid's toy voiceovers, check out my <a href=\"/pop-up-pirate-voiceover\" title=\"Pop-up Pirate\">Pop-up Pirate</a> and <a href=\"/bugs-in-kitchen-voice\" title=\"Bugs in the Kitchen Voiceover\">Bugs in the Kitchen</a> videos too. \r\n</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/YtTD1k-AGJY","title":"Gooey Louie Voiceover","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-card","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/gooey-louie-voiceover.jpg","alt":"Gooey Louie Voiceover","className":"blog-post-img"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-caption","children":"Gooey Louie Voiceover"}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>What is Gooey Louie?</h2>\r\n<p>This gruesome <a href=\"https://www.smythstoys.com/uk/en-gb/toys/games-puzzles-and-books/board-games/children-s-board-games/gooey-louie-board-game/p/199638\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Gooey Louie GameE\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Gooey Louie Game</a> will have you laughing for hours. Take it in turns to stick your finger up poor Louie's nose and pull out many stretch gooeys, eurgh! Be careful if you pull out the wrong gooey then his eyes will bulge and his brain will explode!<br> Pull out one of Louie's many stretchy gooeys, it could be short or it could be long! This is such a fun, delightfully gross board game and it was a lot of fun to provide the voiceover for the TV ad!</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Need this style?</h2>\r\n<p>Are you looking for this energetic voice style for your next <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">TV ad</a>, or perhaps even for a more specialist <a href=\"/explainer-video-voice\"  title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a>? Please <a href=\"/contact-guy\" title=\"Get in touch\">get in touch</a>. I'd be very happy to send a short sample before you book me. Please send a few lines of the script first so you can be sure I'm right for the brand or project. I make the whole process as easy as possible with 99% of the jobs delivered the same day.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Gooey Louie Voiceover","pageUrl":"gooey-louie-voiceover"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","994",{"href":"/mustard-car-van-insurance-radio-advert-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/mustard-car-van-insurance-radio-advert-voiceover.webp","alt":"Mustard Car and Van Insurance Radio Advert Voiceover - Guy Harris","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Mustard Car and Van Insurance Voiceover"}]]}],["$","$L3","681",{"href":"/worms-wmd-character-voices","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/worms-wmd-character-voices.jpg","alt":"Worms WMD Character Voices","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Worms WMD Character Voices"}]]}],["$","$L3","897",{"href":"/ford-trucks-international-a-million-thanks","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap